      <rules>
        <rule name="Runts" id="ede58024-bd4e-c015-d4e2-a2288291fc59" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>Goblins may gain experience but if they happen to roll ‘That Lad’s got talent’ they are immediately killed by their Orc overlords for becoming too ‘mouthy’ (remove the Gobbo from the roster).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Goblin Animosity" id="6ade-a757-2c92-d2b2" hidden="false">
          <description>A Goblin Warrior who fails his Animosity test and rolls a 1 for the result will never charge an Orc Henchman, though he will still use any missile weapons to attack as normal.
Goblins are far too afraid of Orcs to challenge them individually.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
